<Base title="Safeguarding | Naya Aasha" description="Naya Aasha's safeguarding commitment."><section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap"><p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Safeguarding</p><p class="eyebrow">Safety and dignity</p><h1 class="display">{policies.safeguardingTitle}</h1></div></section><section class="section"><div class="narrow prose"><p>{policies.safeguardingText}</p><h2>Report a concern</h2><p>Contact <a class="text-link" href={`mailto:${policies.complaintsEmail}`}>{policies.complaintsEmail}</a>. If someone is in immediate danger, contact the appropriate emergency or protection service.</p><h2>Our minimum standards</h2><ul><li>Do no harm and act in the best interests of children and adults at risk.</li><li>Obtain appropriate consent for stories, images, and personal information.</li><li>Limit access to confidential information.</li><li>Provide safe ways to report concerns without retaliation.</li><li>Assess staff, volunteers, partners, and activities for safeguarding risk.</li></ul><p class="notice">A qualified safeguarding professional should approve the organization’s full internal policy and reporting procedure.</p></div></section></Base>
